description "Deadeye Duncan

The 5th best ranked duelist on Taris, out of 5...

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 50% Less Damage
- The Deadeye Decimator (T-21 1)
-- 80% Faster RoF
-- 75% less Dmg
- Thermal Grenades (20)
-- 90% Faster RoF
- Confusion Grenades (3)
-- Frag Grenade
-- 0 Damage, Flashes/Slippery In Large Radius
- Pulse Screen Canister
-- Pulse Grenade
-- 100% Higher Damage, Spreads Smoke Screen

^8Attributes:
- 90% Faster Cooldowns
- 50% more Kb Taken/Given
- Grapple Hop
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (1)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (2)
- Getup (3)

^3Abilities:
- Rambling Man (Toxic Taunt)
- Pure Luck (Dodge 3) ^3[CS1]
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS2]
- Stimpack ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook (3) ^3[CS4]"
